cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Vey: a lightweight machine-native decision runtime"
message: "If you use Vey in your research, please cite this work."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Vey Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fazin-ahamed/vey"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Vey is a lightweight decision runtime for fast, typed decisions without
  autoregressive generation. It composes exact structured decisions, a frozen
  24M semantic encoder, BM25 and semantic rank fusion, typed tool/action
  compilation, and calibrated trust and abstention.
